{"id":4216,"date":"2023-06-21T08:40:10","date_gmt":"2023-06-21T08:40:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=4216"},"modified":"2024-02-18T16:31:29","modified_gmt":"2024-02-18T16:31:29","slug":"venue-and-useful-information","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/leiden2024\/venue-and-useful-information\/","title":{"rendered":"Venue and useful information"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Getting there<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Leiden is situated just a stone&#8217;s throw from major cities like The Hague and Amsterdam.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Train and bus connections<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Leiden is easy to reach by public transport. The city centre is a few steps from <a href=\"http:\/\/www.ns.nl\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Leiden Central station<\/a>. The Hague is ten minutes away by train, and Amsterdam thirty-five minutes.<br>The bus station is right in front of Leiden Central station and there are many <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arriva.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">routes serving the city and the region<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Public transportation information is integrated into Google Maps. You can also download the NS (Nederlandse Spoorwegen) app for your mobile for detailed information about trains and&nbsp; train stations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Airports<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.schiphol.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Schiphol Airport<\/a> (IATA: AMS) is less than twenty minutes away.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Venue<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">SWAT4HCLS 2024 will be held in Leiden, The Netherlands and online. The venue will be the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wellnesshotelleiden.nl\/en\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Fletcher Wellness-Hotel<\/a> Leiden, shown on the image below on the left side of the&nbsp;LUMC (Leiden University Medical Center).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>Full Hotel Address<\/summary>\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/RE5axNBzrTburB4h9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FLETCHER WELLNESS-HOTEL LEIDEN<\/a><\/strong>\nBargelaan 180\n2333 CW Leiden\n+31 (0)71 - 870 02 60\n<a href=\"mailto:info@wellnesshotelleiden.nl\">info@wellnesshotelleiden.nl<\/a><\/pre>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Hotel&nbsp;is located behind Leiden\u2019s Central Station and is within walking distance. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wellnesshotelleiden.nl\/en\/contact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">More information can be found here.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/LUMC-4mp-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"LUMC\" class=\"wp-image-3483\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/LUMC-4mp-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/LUMC-4mp-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Accommodation at <strong>Fletcher Wellness-Hotel<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Single Rooms can be booked at\u00a0\u00a0<a class=\"\" href=\"mailto:banquetsales@wellnesshotelleiden.nl\">banquetsales@wellnesshotelleiden.nl<\/a>.\u00a0To get the discounted price of 107 EUR pp \/ night\u00a0(including breakfast and excluding city\u00a0tax) for a single room you will need to use the promo code. You will receive the code in the confirmation email, after you register to the event.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Note: Fletcher has informed us that they are fully booked for the night of February 27.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Other Hotels near Fletcher Wellness-Hotel&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/@52.1675593,4.4721275,15z?entry=ttu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"916\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walking-times-around-Fletcher-Hotel-Leiden-916x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4275 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walking-times-around-Fletcher-Hotel-Leiden-916x1024.png 916w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walking-times-around-Fletcher-Hotel-Leiden-268x300.png 268w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walking-times-around-Fletcher-Hotel-Leiden-768x858.png 768w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/walking-times-around-Fletcher-Hotel-Leiden.png 1360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 916px) 100vw, 916px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>IBIS&nbsp; \u20ac &nbsp;<\/strong><br><a href=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/rz2KrV8ApMxZHSVG9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stationsplein 240-242, 2312 AR Leiden<\/a><br>5 minutes from venue.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Golden Tulip &amp; Tulip Inn Leiden Centre \u20ac\u20ac <\/strong><br><a href=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/yH3J3Mgx7TDdbk4VA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Schipholweg 3, 2316 XB Leiden<\/a><br>9 minutes from venue.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Hotel VIC \u20ac<\/strong><br><a href=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/whyo1KC1SDQiTva69\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Schuttersveld 2-4, 2316 ZA Leiden<\/a><br>9 minutes from venue.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">See <a href=\"https:\/\/goldengreenhotels.nl\/en\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/goldengreenhotels.nl\/en\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Golden Green Hotels<\/a> for IBIS, Golden Tulip &amp; Tulip Inn Centre and Hotel VIC.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About Leiden<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A university city since 1575, Leiden has been one of Europe&#8217;s most prominent scientific centres for more than four centuries. University buildings are scattered throughout the city and the many students from all over the world give the city a bustling, vivid and international atmosphere. Leiden offers many&nbsp;historical attractions and&nbsp;great spots to visit.&nbsp;Canals, city gates, bridges and mills, courtyard gardens make up the city center.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"736\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Stadstimmerwerf-Galgewater-Molen-De-Put-1024x736.jpg\" alt=\"Leiden canals\" class=\"wp-image-3486\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Stadstimmerwerf-Galgewater-Molen-De-Put-1024x736.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Stadstimmerwerf-Galgewater-Molen-De-Put-300x216.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Jean-Pesijnhofje.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"645\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Jean-Pesijnhofje-1024x645.jpg\" alt=\"Leiden courtyards\" class=\"wp-image-3487\" style=\"width:840px;height:529px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Jean-Pesijnhofje-1024x645.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Jean-Pesijnhofje-300x189.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:31px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Many museums, the most notable is the Hortus Botanicus (botanical garden), a taxonomer&#8217;s paradise.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Hortus-botanicus-tuin.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Hortus-botanicus-tuin-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Hortus botanicus Leiden \" class=\"wp-image-3488\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Hortus-botanicus-tuin-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/Hortus-botanicus-tuin-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Places to visit in Leiden<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Walks<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitleiden.nl\/en\/highlights\/courtyard-gardens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Typical courtyards, walk route \/ tour<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.gpsmycity.com\/tours\/in-the-footsteps-of-young-rembrandt-4920.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jong Rembrandt walk route<\/a> <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/muurgedichten.nl\/en\/routes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wall poems<\/a> <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.singelpark.nl\/activiteiten\/routes\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Singelpark<\/a> surrounds the historic center of Leiden with greenery. A city park for miles long with the water of the canals like a blue vein through the park. <\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Boat<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitleiden.nl\/en\/locations\/2001566054\/rederij-rembrandt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Boat trip<\/a>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Monuments<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitleiden.nl\/en\/highlights\/courtyard-gardens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Typical courtyards, walk route \/ tour<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.gpsmycity.com\/tours\/in-the-footsteps-of-young-rembrandt-4920.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jong Rembrandt walk route<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.universiteitleiden.nl\/old-observatory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Old Observatory Leiden<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.molendeput.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mill \u2018de Put\u2019<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.hooglandsekerk.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hooglandse Kerk<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.pieterskerk.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pieterskerk<\/a> <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.marekerk.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Marekerk<\/a> <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitleiden.nl\/en\/locations\/2380897422\/de-burcht\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Burcht, fortress<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitleiden.nl\/nl\/locaties\/2666699515\/koornbrug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bridge \u2018Koornbrug\u2019<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitleiden.nl\/en\/culture\/city-walks\/rembrandt-route\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rembrandtplein &amp; bridge<\/a>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Museums<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/hortusleiden.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hortus Botanicus Leiden<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.volkenkunde.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Volkenkunde<\/a> <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.rijksmuseumboerhaave.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rijksmuseum Boerhaave<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.lakenhal.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">De Lakenhal<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.rmo.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rijksmuseum van Oudheden<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http:\/\/www.naturalis.nl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Naturalis<\/a>. <\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">More information at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitleiden.nl\/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Leiden tourist information.<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Getting there Leiden is situated just a stone&#8217;s throw from major cities like The Hague and Amsterdam. Train and bus connections Leiden is easy to reach by public transport. The city centre is a few steps from Leiden Central station. &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/leiden2024\/venue-and-useful-information\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":4280,"parent":4207,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4216","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4216","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4216"}],"version-history":[